            %p
              This page originates in notes prepared for a talk “Fractures, Ideles and the Differential Hexagon” at
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a{:href => "http://qcpages.qc.cuny.edu/~swilson/cunyworkshop14.html"} CUNY workshop on differential cohomologies
              = succeed ")" do
                %a{:href => "http://videostreaming.gc.cuny.edu/videos/video/1806/"} video recording
          %h1#contents Contents
          .maruku_toc
            %ul
              %li
                %a{:href => "#motivation"} Motivation
              %li
