                  the various
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+fibers"} homotopy fibers
                  of
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
