                      – is obtained by “
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+concretification"}> differential concretification
                      ” (see
                      %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Differential+cohomology+is+Cohesive+homotopy+theory"} Schreiber 14
                      for more);
                  %li
                    %p
                      for
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
